{"id":"d6da6d3f3489ef90","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-propositional-syntax.md","title":"Propositional Syntax and Semantics","display":"df-propositional-syntax — Propositional Syntax and Semantics","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-propositional-syntax","aliases":["72-df-propositional-syntax"],"display":"df-propositional-syntax — Propositional Syntax and Semantics","depends_on":[],"source_location":"Buss, Chapter I, section 1 and Definition 1.1.1; printed pp. 3-5; PDF pp. 15-17","source_statement_status":"source-statement-compared","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked","round2_verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-propositional-syntax"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-propositional-syntax</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-propositional-syntax — Propositional Syntax and Semantics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Buss, Chapter I, section 1 and Definition 1.1.1; printed pp. 3-5; PDF pp. 15-17"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"source-statement-compared"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>在 ZFC 元语言中用有序对及两两不同的自然数标签构造有限语法树；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,n\\in\\omega\">\\(i,n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。命题变量、联结词构造子与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}\">\\(\\mathsf{Term}\\)</span> 在 Assertion 中给出。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)\\)</span> 表示集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的有限子集全体。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>有限序列采用以自然数为定义域的函数编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 遍历有限函数序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lh}\">\\(\\operatorname{lh}\\)</span> 是下式定义的项数函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,1\\}^*:=\\bigcup_{m\\in\\omega}\\{0,1\\}^m\">\\(\\{0,1\\}^*:=\\bigcup_{m\\in\\omega}\\{0,1\\}^m\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}:\\omega\\to\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}:\\omega\\to\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 在 Assertion 中定义。变量名称的大小计入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta(i)\">\\(\\beta(i)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}\\)</span> 是公式、有限公式序列、有限子句集合及它们的有限元组的固定单射二进制编码。给定编码算法及其逆解析算法，二者在不共享子树的显式有限树/列表表示上均为多项式时间；编码不共享重复子树。公式与证明序列的编码大小满足下列同一个固定常数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\geq1\">\\(c\\geq1\\)</span>、整数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\geq1\">\\(d\\geq1\\)</span> 的界；有限集合按编码字典序列出并作列表编码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|x|\">\\(|x|\\)</span> 对串表示位数，对语法对象表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\operatorname{enc}(x)|\">\\(|\\operatorname{enc}(x)|\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Term}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Term}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathsf{PV}}\">\\(a\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathsf{PV}}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{PV}\\to\\mathsf{Term}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{PV}\\to\\mathsf{Term}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对布尔值使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1\">\\(0,1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min,\\max\">\\(\\min,\\max\\)</span> 及通常的整数运算。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TAUT}\">\\(\\mathrm{TAUT}\\)</span> 是 Assertion 构造的重言式编码集合。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lh}(s):=\\operatorname{dom}(s).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{lh}(s):=\\operatorname{dom}(s).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{bin}(0)&amp;:=\\langle0\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{bin}(n)&amp;:=\\iota b\\in\\bigcup_{m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}}\\{0,1\\}^m\n\\left[b_0=1\\land n=\\sum_{j&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(b)}b_j2^{\\operatorname{lh}(b)-1-j}\\right]\\quad(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}),\\\\\n\\beta(i)&amp;:=\\operatorname{lh}(\\operatorname{bin}(i)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{bin}(0)&amp;:=\\langle0\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{bin}(n)&amp;:=\\iota b\\in\\bigcup_{m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}}\\{0,1\\}^m\n\\left[b_0=1\\land n=\\sum_{j&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(b)}b_j2^{\\operatorname{lh}(b)-1-j}\\right]\\quad(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}),\\\\\n\\beta(i)&amp;:=\\operatorname{lh}(\\operatorname{bin}(i)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p_i:=\\langle0,i\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathsf{PV}:=\\{p_i:i\\in\\omega\\},\\qquad\n\\bot:=\\langle1,0\\rangle,\\qquad\\top:=\\langle2,0\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\neg A:=\\langle3,A\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p_i:=\\langle0,i\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathsf{PV}:=\\{p_i:i\\in\\omega\\},\\qquad\n\\bot:=\\langle1,0\\rangle,\\qquad\\top:=\\langle2,0\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\neg A:=\\langle3,A\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\land B:=\\langle4,\\langle A,B\\rangle\\rangle,\\quad\nA\\lor B:=\\langle5,\\langle A,B\\rangle\\rangle,\\quad\nA\\to B:=\\langle6,\\langle A,B\\rangle\\rangle,\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B:=\\langle7,\\langle A,B\\rangle\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\land B:=\\langle4,\\langle A,B\\rangle\\rangle,\\quad\nA\\lor B:=\\langle5,\\langle A,B\\rangle\\rangle,\\quad\nA\\to B:=\\langle6,\\langle A,B\\rangle\\rangle,\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B:=\\langle7,\\langle A,B\\rangle\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_0:=\\mathsf{PV}\\cup\\{\\bot,\\top\\},\\qquad\nT_{n+1}:=T_n\\cup\\{\\neg A:A\\in T_n\\}\\cup\n\\{A\\circ B:A,B\\in T_n,\\;\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Term}:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}T_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_0:=\\mathsf{PV}\\cup\\{\\bot,\\top\\},\\qquad\nT_{n+1}:=T_n\\cup\\{\\neg A:A\\in T_n\\}\\cup\n\\{A\\circ B:A,B\\in T_n,\\;\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Term}:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}T_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fml}:=\\mathsf{Term},\\qquad\\mathsf{Asn}:=\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathsf{PV}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Fml}:=\\mathsf{Term},\\qquad\\mathsf{Asn}:=\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathsf{PV}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell(p_i):=1+\\beta(i),\\quad\\ell(\\bot):=\\ell(\\top):=1,\\quad\n\\ell(\\neg A):=1+\\ell(A),\\quad\n\\ell(A\\circ B):=1+\\ell(A)+\\ell(B)\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell(p_i):=1+\\beta(i),\\quad\\ell(\\bot):=\\ell(\\top):=1,\\quad\n\\ell(\\neg A):=1+\\ell(A),\\quad\n\\ell(A\\circ B):=1+\\ell(A)+\\ell(B)\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell(\\pi):=1+\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)+\\sum_{i&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)}\\ell(\\pi_i)\n\\quad(\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Fml}^{&lt;\\omega}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell(\\pi):=1+\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)+\\sum_{i&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)}\\ell(\\pi_i)\n\\quad(\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Fml}^{&lt;\\omega}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\in\\mathsf{Fml}\\cup\\mathsf{Fml}^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\bigl(\n\\ell(x)\\leq c(|\\operatorname{enc}(x)|+1)^d\\land\n|\\operatorname{enc}(x)|\\leq c(\\ell(x)+1)^d\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall x\\in\\mathsf{Fml}\\cup\\mathsf{Fml}^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\bigl(\n\\ell(x)\\leq c(|\\operatorname{enc}(x)|+1)^d\\land\n|\\operatorname{enc}(x)|\\leq c(\\ell(x)+1)^d\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Var}(p_i)&amp;=\\{p_i\\},&amp;\n\\operatorname{Var}(\\bot)&amp;=\\operatorname{Var}(\\top)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Var}(\\neg A)&amp;=\\operatorname{Var}(A),&amp;\n\\operatorname{Var}(A\\circ B)&amp;=\\operatorname{Var}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{Var}(B)\n\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Var}(p_i)&amp;=\\{p_i\\},&amp;\n\\operatorname{Var}(\\bot)&amp;=\\operatorname{Var}(\\top)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Var}(\\neg A)&amp;=\\operatorname{Var}(A),&amp;\n\\operatorname{Var}(A\\circ B)&amp;=\\operatorname{Var}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{Var}(B)\n\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n⟦ p_i⟧_a&amp;=a(p_i),&amp;\n⟦\\bot⟧_a&amp;=0,&amp;⟦\\top⟧_a&amp;=1,\\\\\n⟦\\neg A⟧_a&amp;=1-⟦ A⟧_a,\\\\\n⟦ A\\land B⟧_a&amp;=\\min(⟦ A⟧_a,⟦ B⟧_a),\\\\\n⟦ A\\lor B⟧_a&amp;=\\max(⟦ A⟧_a,⟦ B⟧_a),\\\\\n⟦ A\\to B⟧_a&amp;=\\max(1-⟦ A⟧_a,⟦ B⟧_a),\\\\\n⟦ A\\leftrightarrow B⟧_a&amp;=1-|⟦ A⟧_a-⟦ B⟧_a|.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n⟦ p_i⟧_a&amp;=a(p_i),&amp;\n⟦\\bot⟧_a&amp;=0,&amp;⟦\\top⟧_a&amp;=1,\\\\\n⟦\\neg A⟧_a&amp;=1-⟦ A⟧_a,\\\\\n⟦ A\\land B⟧_a&amp;=\\min(⟦ A⟧_a,⟦ B⟧_a),\\\\\n⟦ A\\lor B⟧_a&amp;=\\max(⟦ A⟧_a,⟦ B⟧_a),\\\\\n⟦ A\\to B⟧_a&amp;=\\max(1-⟦ A⟧_a,⟦ B⟧_a),\\\\\n⟦ A\\leftrightarrow B⟧_a&amp;=1-|⟦ A⟧_a-⟦ B⟧_a|.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Taut}&amp;=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fml}:\\forall a\\in\\mathsf{Asn}\\;⟦ A⟧_a=1\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{TAUT}&amp;=\\{\\operatorname{enc}(A):A\\in\\mathsf{Taut}\\},\\\\\nS\\models A&amp;\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall a\\in\\mathsf{Asn}\\;\\bigl((\\forall B\\in S\\;⟦ B⟧_a=1)\\to⟦ A⟧_a=1\\bigr)\n\\quad(S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fml},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Fml}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Taut}&amp;=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fml}:\\forall a\\in\\mathsf{Asn}\\;⟦ A⟧_a=1\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{TAUT}&amp;=\\{\\operatorname{enc}(A):A\\in\\mathsf{Taut}\\},\\\\\nS\\models A&amp;\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall a\\in\\mathsf{Asn}\\;\\bigl((\\forall B\\in S\\;⟦ B⟧_a=1)\\to⟦ A⟧_a=1\\bigr)\n\\quad(S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fml},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Fml}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Sub}&amp;=\\mathsf{Fml}^{\\mathsf{PV}},\\\\\n\\widehat\\sigma(p_i)&amp;=\\sigma(p_i),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\\widehat\\sigma(\\top)=\\top,\\\\\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)&amp;=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\qquad\n\\widehat\\sigma(A\\circ B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\circ\\widehat\\sigma(B)\n\\quad(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Sub},\\ \\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Sub}&amp;=\\mathsf{Fml}^{\\mathsf{PV}},\\\\\n\\widehat\\sigma(p_i)&amp;=\\sigma(p_i),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\\widehat\\sigma(\\top)=\\top,\\\\\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)&amp;=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\qquad\n\\widehat\\sigma(A\\circ B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\circ\\widehat\\sigma(B)\n\\quad(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Sub},\\ \\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Buss，Chapter I，§1，印刷页 3–5，PDF 页 15–17；同时代入见 Definition 1.1.1。这里明确加入书中列出的两个零元布尔联结词，以允许没有公共变量的插值公式。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>公式与其二进制编码在本节点中分开：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Taut}\">\\(\\mathsf{Taut}\\)</span> 的元素是公式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TAUT}\">\\(\\mathrm{TAUT}\\)</span> 的元素是串。递归均沿有限语法树进行，因而唯一确定。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本次逐项比较了语法、真值表、有效性及同时代入的来源陈述；没有把标准编码的复杂性或自由项代数构造作机器形式化。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>接续复核将有限语法树的阶段构造移入 Assertion，并明示公式树与证明序列编码大小的双向多项式界。各标签互异，阶段并恰为有限树；所有求值/代入递归均严格减小子树。没有把共享 DAG 编码当成普通 Frege 公式大小。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"i,n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Term}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{lh}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0,1\\}^*:=\\bigcup_{m\\in\\omega}\\{0,1\\}^m","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}:\\omega\\to\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta(i)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}","display":false},{"tex":"c\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"d\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"|x|","display":false},{"tex":"|\\operatorname{enc}(x)|","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Term}","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathsf{PV}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma:\\mathsf{PV}\\to\\mathsf{Term}","display":false},{"tex":"0,1","display":false},{"tex":"\\min,\\max","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TAUT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{lh}(s):=\\operatorname{dom}(s).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{bin}(0)&:=\\langle0\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{bin}(n)&:=\\iota b\\in\\bigcup_{m\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}}\\{0,1\\}^m\n\\left[b_0=1\\land n=\\sum_{j<\\operatorname{lh}(b)}b_j2^{\\operatorname{lh}(b)-1-j}\\right]\\quad(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}),\\\\\n\\beta(i)&:=\\operatorname{lh}(\\operatorname{bin}(i)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"p_i:=\\langle0,i\\rangle,\\qquad\\mathsf{PV}:=\\{p_i:i\\in\\omega\\},\\qquad\n\\bot:=\\langle1,0\\rangle,\\qquad\\top:=\\langle2,0\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\neg A:=\\langle3,A\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"A\\land B:=\\langle4,\\langle A,B\\rangle\\rangle,\\quad\nA\\lor B:=\\langle5,\\langle A,B\\rangle\\rangle,\\quad\nA\\to B:=\\langle6,\\langle A,B\\rangle\\rangle,\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B:=\\langle7,\\langle A,B\\rangle\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"T_0:=\\mathsf{PV}\\cup\\{\\bot,\\top\\},\\qquad\nT_{n+1}:=T_n\\cup\\{\\neg A:A\\in T_n\\}\\cup\n\\{A\\circ B:A,B\\in T_n,\\;\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Term}:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}T_n.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fml}:=\\mathsf{Term},\\qquad\\mathsf{Asn}:=\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathsf{PV}}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\ell(p_i):=1+\\beta(i),\\quad\\ell(\\bot):=\\ell(\\top):=1,\\quad\n\\ell(\\neg A):=1+\\ell(A),\\quad\n\\ell(A\\circ B):=1+\\ell(A)+\\ell(B)\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\ell(\\pi):=1+\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)+\\sum_{i<\\operatorname{lh}(\\pi)}\\ell(\\pi_i)\n\\quad(\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Fml}^{<\\omega}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall x\\in\\mathsf{Fml}\\cup\\mathsf{Fml}^{<\\omega}\\;\\bigl(\n\\ell(x)\\leq c(|\\operatorname{enc}(x)|+1)^d\\land\n|\\operatorname{enc}(x)|\\leq c(\\ell(x)+1)^d\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Var}(p_i)&=\\{p_i\\},&\n\\operatorname{Var}(\\bot)&=\\operatorname{Var}(\\top)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Var}(\\neg A)&=\\operatorname{Var}(A),&\n\\operatorname{Var}(A\\circ B)&=\\operatorname{Var}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{Var}(B)\n\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n⟦ p_i⟧_a&=a(p_i),&\n⟦\\bot⟧_a&=0,&⟦\\top⟧_a&=1,\\\\\n⟦\\neg A⟧_a&=1-⟦ A⟧_a,\\\\\n⟦ A\\land B⟧_a&=\\min(⟦ A⟧_a,⟦ B⟧_a),\\\\\n⟦ A\\lor B⟧_a&=\\max(⟦ A⟧_a,⟦ B⟧_a),\\\\\n⟦ A\\to B⟧_a&=\\max(1-⟦ A⟧_a,⟦ B⟧_a),\\\\\n⟦ A\\leftrightarrow B⟧_a&=1-|⟦ A⟧_a-⟦ B⟧_a|.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Taut}&=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fml}:\\forall a\\in\\mathsf{Asn}\\;⟦ A⟧_a=1\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{TAUT}&=\\{\\operatorname{enc}(A):A\\in\\mathsf{Taut}\\},\\\\\nS\\models A&\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall a\\in\\mathsf{Asn}\\;\\bigl((\\forall B\\in S\\;⟦ B⟧_a=1)\\to⟦ A⟧_a=1\\bigr)\n\\quad(S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fml},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Fml}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Sub}&=\\mathsf{Fml}^{\\mathsf{PV}},\\\\\n\\widehat\\sigma(p_i)&=\\sigma(p_i),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\\widehat\\sigma(\\top)=\\top,\\\\\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)&=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\qquad\n\\widehat\\sigma(A\\circ B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\circ\\widehat\\sigma(B)\n\\quad(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Sub},\\ \\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Taut}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TAUT}","display":false}],"bytes":5922,"backlinks":[{"id":"789eea8538e194e6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{PV}$ 是 [[72-df-propositional-syntax]] 的命题变量集合，$X\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{PV})$，$a:X\\to\\{0,1\\}$。"},{"id":"c53ee8b5af941c0e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Frege}(R)$，$\\operatorname{Step}_R$ 如 [[72-df-frege-system]]；$\\mathsf{PV},\\mathsf{Fml},\\operatorname{Var}$ 如 [[72-df-propositional-syntax]]。"},{"id":"f35aac82e2971e68","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{Fml},\\mathsf{Sub},\\widehat\\sigma,\\models$ 如 [[72-df-propositional-syntax]]；固定该节点的有限完备联结词基。"},{"id":"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$，$\\mathrm{TAUT}\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$ 是命题重言式的固定二进制编码集合（见 [[72-df-propositional-syntax]]）。"},{"id":"e585861c4ee3b135","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数